  "details": "In version 1319 according to menu. But I was in the IK beta.\n\nFriend was on 1319 live.\n\nMy friend had an emoji set to the idea animation. And then swapped it to the stop animation. A while after that I realized something was up in the sky. After closer inspection it was said emoji up in the air playing it's animation on loop. Roughly where the world origin was. So I assume editing the emoji was the thing triggering it.\n\nI was the only person that saw the problem. No other person in the instance saw it. \n\nSending the emoji again didn't help. And this lasted for like another 30 minutes or so until I left that instance.\n\nVideo showing the problem.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/cVYiK8Y3a3U\n\nLogs.\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/Tummy-git/14ff67e700ae80df83747244cad31a40\n\nEncountered in this world.\n\nwrld_daacf056-7ca1-4984-ba0e-8d86a0fd3fa6",
